# The same waveguide on six grids that all place cell edges on its walls.
# Reference: the same grid solved with a sparse eigen-solver in SciPy.
title Silicon strip 480 x 240 nm on a 12 nm grid, quasi-TM
grid dx=0.012 dy=0.012
window width=2.4 ymin=-0.72 ymax=0.96
rect si -0.24 0.24 0 0.24
symmetry even
field tm
expect neff 1.983040910 2e-8
expect group_index 4.162358678 2e-6
expect guided yes
expect cells 14000
